# Keep this folder in the repository even when it is empty.
# Put your dataset here BEFORE running train.py.
#
# Structure (one folder per class/disease):
#   dataset/
#       Tomato___Early_blight/
#           image1.jpg
#           image2.jpg
#       Tomato___Late_blight/
#           image1.jpg
#       Tomato___healthy/
#           image1.jpg
#
# The class name is taken from the folder name automatically.